msgid "Define tasks and checklists that change based on attribute values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-playbooks.rst:195
msgid "Create adaptive workflows that change based on real-time data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-playbooks.rst:197
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`conditional tasks <end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-"
"with-tasks:conditional tasks>` documentation for details on configuring "
"conditional tasks within playbooks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-playbooks.rst:200
msgid "Run metrics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-playbooks.rst:202
msgid ""
"The **Usage** tab in the workflow dashboard provides run metrics for that"
" playbook. These metrics are available to all viewers. It's not possible "
"to edit or add to these metrics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-playbooks.rst:205
